{"id":"diebstahl","lemma":"Diebstahl","pos":"noun","rank":3001,"glosses":["theft"],"ipa":"/ˈdiːpˌʃtaːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/De-Diebstahl.ogg/De-Diebstahl.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Diebstahles","plural":"Diebstähle"},"formAudio":{"Diebstähle":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Diebst%C3%A4hle.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie melde ich einen Diebstahl?","en":"How do I report a theft?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to report, to inform","l":"melden"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Er kam für Diebstahl ins Gefängnis.","en":"He was in prison on a charge of robbery.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"into the"},{"g":"prison, jail"}]},{"text":"Ich kann für Sie keinen Diebstahl begehen.","en":"I can't steal for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755832","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to commit, perpetrate"}]},{"text":"Die Polizei beschuldigte ihn des Diebstahles.","en":"The police accused him of theft.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"to accuse, to blame","l":"beschuldigen"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte einen Diebstahl melden.","en":"I'd like to report a theft.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to report, to inform"}]}]}